  "id": "process-research",
  "term": "process research",
  "definition": "In counselling, process research studies what happens during therapy and how those in-therapy changes relate to the results of an intervention. It focuses on identifying meaningful change processes within therapeutic interactions and finding ways to measure these complex, layered processes.",
